{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>ותם לריק etc.</b> As though it said ״וְתַם כֹּחֲכֶם לָרִיק״ — meaning, that their strength will be utterly in vain. And inasmuch as sometimes the destroyer prevails only over a part, here HaShem made known that they will prevail over everything — may the Merciful One spare us:"], :book :leviticus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:02:15.082819160Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}